# autorhythm: the FR-2L bossanova, the rhythm the whole enquiry started from.
# Boots on the FR-2L (machine 0) at rhythm 0; RIGHT once lands on Bossanova, which is
# the second block in doc §8.1. Then SPACE runs the machine's clock.
#
# The clock defaults to 8 ticks/second, which on a 6-per-beat rhythm is 80 bpm: slow
# enough that the two-bar clave is audible as an asymmetry rather than a texture.
tap 20 RIGHT
tap 40 SPACE
